  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 103.05 Active portion",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 103.05 “Active portion” means that portion of a hazardous waste facility where treatment, storage, or disposal operations are being or have been conducted on or after November 19, 1980. The term does not include any portion of a hazardous waste facility that has been closed in accordance with a closure plan approved in accordance with Env-Hw 707.03 and Env-Hw 708.02 or predecessor rules in subtitle Env-Wm or He-P.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Hw 100) #12343, eff 8-14-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-hw100.html"
